<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill Lynch EPS raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill Lynch EPS raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Brown Brothers Harriman said analyst Raphael Soifer increased his earnings for Merrill Lynch and Co Inc to $7.7O per share from $7.50, and kept the 1998 estimated unchanged at $8.</p>
<p>-- Kept the stock rated outperform/hold.</p>
<p>-- While Soifer remains bullish on the stock, &quot;the stock market's recent choppiness related to interest rates may not yet have fully run its course.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/8 to 89.</p>
</text>
